            },
            "body": "Closing after re-evaluating against `AGENTS.md` (duplicate-work checks).\n\nvLLM already exposes `POST /v1/chat/completions/derender` and `POST /v1/completions/derender`, and `ServingDerender` runs the configured tool/reasoning parser to return `reasoning`, `content` and `tool_calls`. That covers the same capability this endpoint proposed; the only difference is text input instead of token IDs. Since the derender path is also the design direction being worked through in #42729, a second, narrower parse surface in the normal OpenAI router does not justify its maintenance cost.\n\nThe branch stays at `nankingjing:parse-function-call-endpoint` if a text-in variant is ever wanted as an addition to the derender design.\n",
